      "message": "They are also necessary to ensure the invariants are upheld. For example, WEBP_COUNTED_BY in this case is enforced on the caller-side, so it needs to be in the signature of the function. \n\nWhile they are visual noise, I do think they can help the reader understand the relationship between the parameters a bit better. In the same vein, if you have suggestions to make this more readable, I\u0027ll happily put in the leg-work to implement them :)",
